Subject: [PATCH] media: iris: apply the low-latency stage selection in iris_set_stage

The low-latency helper was introduced but iris_set_stage still only looked at
the resolution, so decode-order sessions ran in stage 2. Add the helper to the
condition now that the intermediate decode_order-only version is gone.
---
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_ctrls.c
@@ -566,7 +566,8 @@
 	u32 work_mode = STAGE_2;
 
 	if (inst->domain == DECODER) {
-		if (iris_res_is_less_than(width, height, 1280, 720))
+		if (iris_res_is_less_than(width, height, 1280, 720) ||
+		    iris_dec_low_latency(inst))
 			work_mode = STAGE_1;
 	}
 
